# IntlQ — AI-Powered Interview Simulation System

A Flask-based web application that simulates real interviews, evaluates candidate answers using NLP, and provides actionable feedback + scores based on role requirements.

## User Review Required

> [!IMPORTANT]
> **Technology Stack Decisions:**
> - **Backend**: Python + Flask (serving HTML templates via Jinja2)
> - **NLP**: scikit-learn (TF-IDF + cosine similarity), NLTK (text cleaning, lemmatization)
> - **Database**: SQLite via SQLAlchemy ORM (lightweight, no server setup)
> - **Voice Input**: Browser-native Web Speech API (no backend STT service needed)
> - **Frontend**: Vanilla HTML/CSS/JS with a premium dark-mode glassmorphism design
>
> This keeps the project **self-contained** with no external API keys or paid services. All NLP runs locally.

> [!WARNING]
> **Resume parser** (`services/resume_parser.py`) and **Dockerfile** are marked as optional/future scope. They will be created as stubs only. We can implement them later.

